   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How Could I Know?**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mymorningjacket2004-09-18.mbho.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 52 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Performance took place on the Bank of America Stage at Zilker Park [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mymorningjacket2004-09-18.mbho.flac16**: taped by Mark Devish; transferred by Peter W. King; source: mbho 603a/ka200n > sound devices mp2 > modSBM > d8 [1]. Also: Recorded with mbho 603a microphones into a Sound Devices MP2 preamp, then modSBM, then a d8 recorder; Processed in Soundforge 9.0 for tracking, fades and resampling, then converted to 16-bit FLAC suited to audio CD [1]",
